<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Support Us — The Protocol Institute</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Support the Protocol Institute's mission to further the study and application of protocols.">
  <link rel="icon" href="/assets/logo-static.png" type="image/png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <style>
    .pitch-deck-container {
      margin: 2.5rem 0 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      background: #e8f0f0;
    }
    .pitch-deck-frame {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border: none;
      display: block;
    }
    .pitch-deck-caption {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #888;
      text-align: right;
      margin-top: 0.4rem;
    }
    .pitch-deck-caption a {
      color: #2A6B6B;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .pitch-deck-caption a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="interior-wrapper">

  <header id="site-header"></header>

  <main class="interior-main">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="page-header">
        <h1>Support Us</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="about-body">
        <p>The Protocol Institute is actively seeking donor and partner support. Our work is outlined in the deck below.</p>

        <div class="pitch-deck-container">
          <iframe src="/pitchdeck/deck.html"
                  title="Protocol Institute — Support Deck"
                  class="pitch-deck-frame"
                  loading="lazy"
                  allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="pitch-deck-caption">
          Use ← → arrow keys to navigate &middot;
          <a href="/pitchdeck/deck.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open full screen ↗</a>
        </p>

        <p>If you're interested in supporting our mission, please contact the Managing Director, <a href="team.html#timber">Timber Stinson-Schroff</a> at <a href="mailto:timber@protocol-institute.org">timber@protocol-institute.org</a>, or the Director of Research, <a href="team.html#venkat">Venkatesh Rao</a> at <a href="mailto:venkat@protocol-institute.org">venkat@protocol-institute.org</a>.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Footer navigation">
      <a href="/team">Team</a>
      <a href="/network">Network</a>
      <a href="/consulting">Consulting</a>
      <a href="/symposium-2026">Symposium</a>
      <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <p>&copy; 2025 The Protocol Institute</p>
  </footer>

</div>

<script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
